---
title: State diagram - case stage (Case.Stage, Case.IsArchived)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> InitialIntake : POST /api/cases (Admin or Consultant)<br>active client + active visa category

    state "Not archived (IsArchived = false)" as Live {
        InitialIntake --> DocumentGathering : advance
        DocumentGathering --> UnderReview : advance
        UnderReview --> SubmittedToAuthority : advance
        SubmittedToAuthority --> FinalDecision : advance
        FinalDecision --> FinalDecision : advance (no change)
    }

    Live --> Archived : not implemented, no endpoint sets IsArchived
    state "Archived (IsArchived = true)" as Archived

    note right of Live
        Stage order enforcement (lifecycle FR-4.4) exists only in
        CaseManagementService.AdvanceCaseStageAsync,
        which no controller calls.
        The live endpoint PATCH /api/cases/{id}/stage
        accepts ANY stage from ANY stage, forward or back,
        including the same stage and archived cases.
        Each change writes CaseStageHistory + AuditLog.
    end note

    note left of Archived
        Column and default exist (false).
        Stats counts skip archived cases.
        Nothing in the API or web ever sets it.
    end note

    classDef missing stroke-dasharray: 6 4,fill:#f5f5f5,color:#555
    class Archived missing
